{"id":"57ebf9aa27784e60","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-tt.md","title":"真值表归约","display":"df-tt — 真值表归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-tt","aliases":["43-df-tt"],"display":"df-tt — 真值表归约","depends_on":["[[43-df-oracle-computation]]","[[43-df-infseq]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_location":"Definition 5.4.3 and following discussion, print p.16 / PDF p.36","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-tt"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-tt</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tt — 真值表归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Definition 5.4.3 and following discussion, print p.16 / PDF p.36"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal O\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal O\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{AsSequence}\">\\(\\mathcal O,\\operatorname{AsSequence}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi_e^C\">\\(\\Phi_e^C\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4400f4836786a4bd\" href=\"?note=4400f4836786a4bd\" title=\"43-df-oracle-computation\">43-df-oracle-computation</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_{\\rm tt}B\\iff\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl((\\forall C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Phi_e^C(x)\\downarrow)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)(x)\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_{\\rm tt}B\\iff\\exists e\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl((\\forall C\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Phi_e^C(x)\\downarrow)\\land\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\Phi_e^B(x)\\downarrow=\\operatorname{AsSequence}(A)(x)\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\rm tt}B\\iff A\\le_{\\rm tt}B\\land B\\le_{\\rm tt}A.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_{\\rm tt}B\\iff A\\le_{\\rm tt}B\\land B\\le_{\\rm tt}A.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>同一程序对每个oracle均总停机；有效紧致性给出每个输入的共同有限查询界。输出关系以图成员形式解释，无需对尚未停机的计算取值。</p>\n<p>来源定位沿用附件：Definition 5.4.3 and following discussion, print p.16 / PDF p.36。本轮核查形式化的内部一致性；未重新核对原书完整证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-oracle-computation","status":"resolved","id":"4400f4836786a4bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-oracle-computatio